The ReSTIR story's math scenes
==============================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) with render_lab's math library (`render_lab_math`): the worked
example of RIS (chapter 2, demos/toy.rs's numbers through the package's natives), stage by stage as `toyStage`
goes from 0 to 23. Each stage is one sentence's animation; `toyDrop` (or the counterfactual stages) removes a
part of W.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]

Colours

The cheap choice's probability p, the target p-hat, a candidate's weight w, the true total, and an estimate.
$[# _pColor "#8fb8ff"]
$[# _targetColor "#ffd166"]
$[# _weightColor "#ff6fb5"]
$[# _totalColor "#6be3b0"]
$[# _estimateColor "#ffa14a"]

Numbers

Fn([Float], String). A number as LaTeX: a fraction with the smallest denominator up to 16 that makes it whole
(4/3, 20/3), else two decimals.
$[# {_rational x}
    [# {_try d} {!if {> d 16}
        {numberLatex x 2}
        {!if {< {abs {- {* x {float d}} {float {round {* x {float d}}}}}} 0.000001}
            {fractionLatex {round {* x {float d}}} d}
            {_try {+ d 1}}}}]
    {_try 1}]
Fn([Int], String). Sample i's name.
$[# {_name i} {!if {= i 0} "A" "B"}]
Fn([Int], String). The cheap choice's probability of sample i, as a fraction.
$[# {_pLatex i} {fractionLatex {toyQuarters i} 4}]
Fn([Int, Int], String). Sample i's weight with `drop`, as a fraction.
$[# {_wLatex i drop} {_rational {toyWeight i drop}}]

The stages

Fn([Float, Float, Float, Float], Float). A value that a removed part of W moves, at stage s: whole until stage 18,
then to its value without the average of the weights (`dropped2`), at stage 19 to its value without the division
by p (`dropped1`), and back at stage 21; outside the story's stages, as `toyDrop` removes a part.
$[# {_moving s whole dropped2 dropped1}
    [# {_by drop} {!if {= drop 2} dropped2 {!if {= drop 1} dropped1 whole}}]
    {!if {< s 18.0}
        {_by {round {toyDrop}}}
        {!if {< s 19.0}
            {lerp whole dropped2 {smooth {phase s 18.0 18.6}}}
            {!if {< s 21.0}
                {lerp dropped2 dropped1 {smooth {phase s 19.0 19.6}}}
                {!if {< s 22.0}
                    {lerp dropped1 whole {smooth {phase s 21.0 21.6}}}
                    {_by {round {toyDrop}}}}}}}]
Fn([Float, List(Mob), List(String), String], List(Mob)). A figure with its parts named in `ids` struck out (`t`).
$[# {_crossParts t mobs ids color} {append
    {filter mobs {^ {m} {not {contains ids {idOf m}}}}}
    {crossOut t {filter mobs {^ {m} {contains ids {idOf m}}}} color}}]
Fn([Float, List(Mob), List(String), String], List(Mob)). A figure with its parts named in `ids` pointed at while `t`
runs.
$[# {_pointParts t mobs ids color} {!if {!and {> t 0.0} {< t 1.0}}
    {append
        {filter mobs {^ {m} {not {contains ids {idOf m}}}}}
        {indicate t {filter mobs {^ {m} {contains ids {idOf m}}}} color}}
    mobs}]

Phase one: two samples, their p, p-hat, and w

Fn([Int, Float], List(Mob)). Sample i's two bars at stage s, p's and p-hat's, each kind scaled to its
larger value: grown as their sentences run, labelled with their values.
$[# {_bars i s}
    [# x {!if {= i 0} -5.2 -2.8}]
    [# base -2.0]
    [# tall 2.6]
    [# p {/ {float {toyQuarters i}} 4.0}]
    [# target {toyBrings i}]
    [# pBox {box {v2 {- x 0.6} base} {v2 {- x 0.1} {+ base {* tall {/ p 0.75}}}}}]
    [# tBox {box {v2 {+ x 0.1} base} {v2 {+ x 0.6} {+ base {* tall {/ target 3.0}}}}}]
    [# pBar {filled f"{p${_name i}}" pBox _pColor 0.9}]
    [# tBar {filled f"{t${_name i}}" tBox _targetColor 0.9}]
    [# pLabel {nextTo {tex f"{pv${_name i}}" {_pLatex i} 0.42 _pColor} pBar up 0.12}]
    [# tLabel {nextTo {tex f"{tv${_name i}}" {str {round target}} 0.42 _targetColor} tBar up 0.12}]
    [# name {moveTo {tex f"{n${_name i}}" {_name i} 0.5 textColor} {v2 x {- base 0.45}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.0 1.0} name}
        {growFrom {phase s 1.0 1.8} pBar down}
        {fadeIn {phase s 1.5 2.0} pLabel}
        {growFrom {phase s 2.0 2.8} tBar down}
        {fadeIn {phase s 2.5 3.0} tLabel}}}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The key to the bars: p in the cheap choice's colour, and p-hat, which stage 3 writes
equal to f.
$[# {_legend s}
    [# p {append
        {filled "keyP" {box {v2 -6.4 3.0} {v2 -6.1 3.3}} _pColor 0.9}
        {moveTo {tex "keyPText" "p" 0.42 _pColor} {v2 -5.75 3.15}}}]
    [# t {append
        {filled "keyT" {box {v2 -4.9 3.0} {v2 -4.6 3.3}} _targetColor 0.9}
        {moveTo {tex "keyTText" f"{\hat p}" 0.42 _targetColor} {v2 -4.25 3.19}}}]
    [# eq {moveTo {tex "keyF" f"{= f}" 0.42 _targetColor} {v2 -3.55 3.15}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeIn {phase s 1.0 1.5} p}
        {fadeIn {phase s 2.0 2.5} t}
        {write {phase s 3.0 4.0} eq}}}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The true total: copies of the two p-hat bars stacked into one column, 1 and 3, braced as 4.
$[# {_total s}
    [# x -0.7]
    [# base -2.0]
    [# unit {/ 2.6 3.0}]
    [# a {filled "totalA"
        {box {v2 {- x 0.25} base} {v2 {+ x 0.25} {+ base unit}}}
        _targetColor
        0.9}]
    [# b {filled "totalB"
        {box {v2 {- x 0.25} {+ base unit}} {v2 {+ x 0.25} {+ base {* 4.0 unit}}}}
        _targetColor
        0.9}]
    [# outline {outlined "totalOutline" {boxOf {append a b}} _totalColor 3.0}]
    [# label {tex "totalValue" {str {round {+ {toyBrings 0} {toyBrings 1}}}} 0.5 _totalColor}]
    [# braced {braceLabel "totalBrace" {append a b} right 0.12 _totalColor label}]
    [# fromA {box {v2 -4.7 -2.0} {v2 -4.2 {+ -2.0 unit}}}]
    [# fromB {box {v2 -2.3 -2.0} {v2 -1.8 {+ -2.0 {* 3.0 unit}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fromCopy {phase s 4.0 4.5} {filled "totalA" fromA _targetColor 0.9} a}
        {fromCopy {phase s 4.2 4.7} {filled "totalB" fromB _targetColor 0.9} b}
        {create {phase s 4.6 5.0} {append outline braced}}}}]
Fn([Int], Table). The table of the samples' p, p-hat, and w (with `drop`), centred on the origin.
$[# {_table drop}
    [# header {'
        {words "h0" "" 0.42 textColor}
        {tex "hp" "p" 0.42 _pColor}
        {tex "ht" f"{\hat p}" 0.42 _targetColor}
        {texParts "hw" f"{w = \frac{\lit{1}{\hat p}}{\lit{2}{p}}}" 0.42 _weightColor
            {' "hwt" "hwp"}
            {' _targetColor _pColor}}}]
    [# {_row i} {'
        {tex f"{r${_name i}}" {_name i} 0.42 textColor}
        {tex f"{c${_name i}p}" {_pLatex i} 0.42 _pColor}
        {tex f"{c${_name i}t}" {str {round {toyBrings i}}} 0.42 _targetColor}
        {tex f"{c${_name i}w}" {_wLatex i drop} 0.42 _weightColor}}]
    {table "table" {' header {_row 0} {_row 1}} 0.14 textDimColor}]

Fn([Float, Table], List(Mob)). The table written at stage 5: its rules and names, then p and p-hat flying from
the bars' labels into their cells, then the weights; stage 6 points at B's.
$[# {_tableShown s t}
    [# {_from id} {withId {flatten {' {_bars 0 3.0} {_bars 1 3.0}}} id}]
    [# {_fly k id cell} {fromCopy
        {phase s {+ 5.0 {* 0.1 {float k}}} {+ 5.4 {* 0.1 {float k}}}}
        {_from id}
        cell}]
    {flatten {'
        {create {phase s 5.0 5.3} {.rules t}}
        {write {phase s 5.0 5.4} {append {rowOf t 0} {append {cellOf t 1 0} {cellOf t 2 0}}}}
        {_fly 0 "pvA" {cellOf t 1 1}}
        {_fly 1 "tvA" {cellOf t 1 2}}
        {_fly 2 "pvB" {cellOf t 2 1}}
        {_fly 3 "tvB" {cellOf t 2 2}}
        {write {phase s 5.5 5.8} {cellOf t 1 3}}
        {indicate {phase s 6.0 7.0} {write {phase s 5.7 6.0} {cellOf t 2 3}} accentColor}}}]

Phase two: two candidates, every list, and their average

Fn([List(Mob), Float, Vec2, Float], List(Mob)). A figure moved toward `to` and scaled toward `scale` as `t` runs.
$[# {_toward mobs scale to t}
    [# k {smooth {clamp t 0.0 1.0}}]
    {moveTo {scaled mobs {lerp 1.0 scale k}} {lerp2 {centerOf mobs} to k}}]

The square of the lists, where the bars were: across, the first candidate (A three quarters of the width, B the
rest); down, the second.
$[# _square [% {box {v2 -6.3 -3.4} {v2 -1.8 1.1}}]]
Fn([], List(Float)). The cheap choice's shares, A's then B's.
$[# {_shares} {map {' 0 1} {^ {i} {/ {float {toyQuarters i}} 4.0}}}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The square, its cells dim, the first candidate named above it and the second beside it.
$[# {_squareFigure s}
    [# cells {areaSquare "sq" {_shares} {_shares} _square {' "#3b4150"} 0.05}]
    [# names {flatten {map
        {' 0 1}
        {^ {i}
            [# c {boxCenter {boxOf {withId cells f"{sq.${str i}.${str i}}"}}}]
            {append
                {moveTo {tex f"{xa${_name i}}" {_name i} 0.42 textDimColor} {v2 {.x c} 1.5}}
                {moveTo {tex f"{xb${_name i}}" {_name i} 0.42 textDimColor} {v2 -6.7 {.y c}}}}}}}]
    {write {phase s 7.6 8.0} {append cells names}}]
Fn([Int, Int], String). The cell of the square where the first candidate is i and the second j.
$[# {_cell i j} f"{sq.${str i}.${str j}}"]
Fn([Int], List({first: Int, second: Int})). The cells of list k (A A, A B or B A, B B).
$[# {_cellsOf k} {!if {= k 0}
    {' {pair 0 0}}
    {!if {= k 1} {' {pair 0 1} {pair 1 0}} {' {pair 1 1}}}}]
Fn([Int, Float, Float, Bool], List(Mob)). List k's cells lit at stage s from `from` (`labels`: their labels
instead), each labelled with its chance in sixteenths (as the narration counts them: an A and a B, in either order,
are 3 and 3 of the 6).
$[# {_listLit k s from labels}
    [# cells {areaSquare "sq" {_shares} {_shares} _square {' _estimateColor} 0.05}]
    [# {_lit c}
        [# id {_cell {.first c} {.second c}}]
        [# chance {* {toyQuarters {.first c}} {toyQuarters {.second c}}}]
        [# label {moveTo
            {tex {++ id "chance"} f"{\tfrac{${str chance}}{16}}" 0.42 textColor}
            {boxCenter {boxOf {withId cells id}}}}]
        {!if labels
            {fadeIn {phase s {+ from 0.3} {+ from 0.7}} label}
            {faded {fadeIn {phase s from {+ from 0.4}} {withId cells id}} 0.75}}]
    {flatten {map {_cellsOf k} _lit}}]

The estimate of one list, as symbols and with each list's numbers: f(y)/p-hat(y) (1 here, as p-hat = f) times the
average of the two weights.
$[# _estimateCenter [% {v2 2.6 0.1}]]
$[# {_estimateSymbols} {moveTo
    {texParts "est" f"{\lit{1}{\frac{f(y)}{\hat p(y)}} \cdot \frac{\lit{2}{w_1} + \lit{3}{w_2}}{\lit{4}{M}}}" 0.5 textColor
        {' "fp" "w1" "w2" "M"}
        {' _targetColor _weightColor _weightColor textColor}}
    _estimateCenter}]
Fn([Int], List(Mob)). List k's estimate with its numbers.
$[# {_estimateNumbers k}
    [# l {nth {toyLists} k}]
    [# value {toyEstimate k 0}]
    [# w1 {_wLatex {.a l} 0}]
    [# w2 {_wLatex {.b l} 0}]
    {moveTo
        {texParts "est" f"{\lit{1}{1} \cdot \frac{\lit{2}{$w1} + \lit{3}{$w2}}{\lit{4}{2}} = \lit{5}{${_rational value}}}" 0.5 textColor
            {' "fp" "w1" "w2" "M" "value"}
            {' _targetColor _weightColor _weightColor textColor _estimateColor}}
        _estimateCenter}]
The average over the lists, each estimate times its chance, which is the true total.
$[# {_averageFormula}
    [# l {toyLists}]
    {moveTo
        {texParts "avg" f"{\tfrac{${str {.sixteenths {nth l 0}}}}{16} \cdot \lit{1}{${_rational {toyEstimate 0 0}}} + \tfrac{${str {.sixteenths {nth l 1}}}}{16} \cdot \lit{2}{${_rational {toyEstimate 1 0}}} + \tfrac{${str {.sixteenths {nth l 2}}}}{16} \cdot \lit{3}{${_rational {toyEstimate 2 0}}} = \lit{4}{${_rational {toyAverage 0}}}}" 0.46 textColor
            {' "e0" "e1" "e2" "avgValue"}
            {' _estimateColor _estimateColor _estimateColor _totalColor}}
        _estimateCenter}]

The number line of the estimates, 0 to 12, under the formulas.
$[# _lineRange [% {axisRange 0.0 12.0 2.0}]]
$[# _lineA [% {v2 -1.4 -2.6}]]
$[# _lineB [% {v2 6.6 -2.6}]]
Fn([Float], Vec2). Where the estimate x is on the line.
$[# {_onLine x} {onLine _lineRange _lineA _lineB x}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The estimates' dots, each as it appears (list k at stage 8 + k, B B at 11), each the
size of its chance, at its value as far as a removed part has moved it.
$[# {_dots s} {flatten {map
    {' 0 1 2}
    {^ {k}
        [# from {!if {= k 2} 11.0 {+ 8.0 {float k}}}]
        [# chance {/ {float {.sixteenths {nth {toyLists} k}}} 16.0}]
        [# value {_moving s {toyEstimate k 0} {toyEstimate k 2} {toyEstimate k 1}}]
        {fadeIn
            {phase s {+ from 0.4} {+ from 0.9}}
            {dotAt f"{dot${str k}}"
                {_onLine value}
                {+ 0.07 {* 0.3 {sqrt chance}}}
                _estimateColor}}}}}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The average's marker under the line, sliding from 0 to the average at stage 13
(to where a removed part moves it later), and the true total's mark at 4 from stage 12, circled late in stage 18.
$[# {_marks s}
    [# avg {_moving s {toyAverage 0} {toyAverage 2} {toyAverage 1}}]
    [# x {lerp 0.0 avg {smooth {phase s 13.3 14.0}}}]
    [# at {_onLine x}]
    [# truth {_onLine {toyAverage 0}}]
    [# total {append
        {dashedLine "truth" {add2 truth {v2 0.0 0.9}} {sub2 truth {v2 0.0 0.2}} _totalColor 2.5}
        {moveTo
            {tex "truthValue" {_rational {toyAverage 0}} 0.42 _totalColor}
            {add2 truth {v2 0.0 1.15}}}}]
    [# marker {arrowLine "mean" {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.95}} {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.35}} _estimateColor 3.0}]
    {append
        {circumscribe {phase s 18.6 19.0} {create {phase s 12.0 12.7} total} _totalColor}
        {fadeIn {phase s 13.0 13.4} marker}}]

Phase three: W, and how often RIS keeps B

$[# _wCenter [% {v2 2.6 0.2}]]
$[# {_wFormula} {moveTo
    {texParts "W" f"{W = \frac{\lit{1}{w_1 + w_2}}{\lit{2}{M}\,\lit{3}{\hat p(y)}}}" 0.55 textColor
        {' "sum" "M" "phat"}
        {' _weightColor textColor _targetColor}}
    _wCenter}]
$[# _keepCenter [% {v2 2.6 -1.35}]]
$[# {_keepSymbols} {moveTo
    {texParts "keep" f"{\overline{W}_B = \frac{1}{\lit{1}{P(y = B)}}}" 0.45 textColor
        {' "chance"}
        {' _estimateColor}}
    _keepCenter}]
$[# {_keepNumbers}
    [# k {toyKept 1}]
    {moveTo
        {texParts "keep" f"{\overline{W}_B = \frac{1}{\lit{1}{${numberLatex {.chance k} 1}}} = \lit{2}{${numberLatex {.w k} 1}}}" 0.45 textColor
            {' "chance" "value"}
            {' _estimateColor _weightColor}}
        _keepCenter}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). Where RIS keeps B: in each A-B cell, B's share of the two weights (12 of 12 + 4/3), and
all of B-B.
$[# {_keptB s}
    [# cells {areaSquare "sq" {_shares} {_shares} _square {' _weightColor} 0.05}]
    [# wa {toyWeight 0 0}]
    [# wb {toyWeight 1 0}]
    [# share {/ wb {+ wa wb}}]
    [# {_part id along}
        [# b {boxOf {withId cells id}}]
        {!if along
            {filled "keptB"
                {box {v2 {- {.x {.hi b}} {* share {boxWidth b}}} {.y {.lo b}}} {.hi b}}
                _weightColor
                0.6}
            {filled "keptB"
                {box {.lo b} {v2 {.x {.hi b}} {+ {.y {.lo b}} {* share {boxHeight b}}}}}
                _weightColor
                0.6}}]
    {fadeIn
        {phase s 17.0 17.5}
        {flatten {'
            {_part {_cell 0 1} false}
            {_part {_cell 1 0} true}
            {filled "keptB" {boxOf {withId cells {_cell 1 1}}} _weightColor 0.6}}}}]

The scene

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The worked example at stage `toyStage`.
$[# toyMath {: {^ {t}
    [# s {toyStage}]
    [# one {flatten {' {_legend s} {_bars 0 s} {_bars 1 s} {_total s}}}]
    [# drop1 {- {smooth {phase s 19.2 19.7}} {smooth {phase s 21.0 21.5}}}]
    [# tables {transform drop1
        {_tableShown s {tableShifted {_table 0} {v2 3.8 0.4}}}
        {_tableShown s {tableShifted {_table 1} {v2 3.8 0.4}}}}]
    [# struck {!if {< s 19.0} 0.0 {- {smooth {phase s 19.0 19.4}} {smooth {phase s 21.0 21.4}}}}]
    [# tableNow {_pointParts
        {phase s 20.0 21.0}
        {_crossParts struck {_toward tables 0.75 {v2 4.0 2.75} {phase s 7.0 7.8}} {' "hwp"} _pColor}
        {' "cBw"}
        accentColor}]
    [# estimate {!if {< s 8.0}
        {fadeIn {phase s 7.6 8.0} {_estimateSymbols}}
        {!if {< s 9.0}
            {transform {phase s 8.0 8.6} {_estimateSymbols} {_estimateNumbers 0}}
            {!if {< s 11.0}
                {circumscribe
                    {phase s 10.0 11.0}
                    {transform {phase s 9.0 9.6} {_estimateNumbers 0} {_estimateNumbers 1}}
                    _targetColor}
                {!if {< s 13.0}
                    {transform {phase s 11.0 11.6} {_estimateNumbers 1} {_estimateNumbers 2}}
                    {!if {< s 15.0}
                        {circumscribe
                            {phase s 14.0 15.0}
                            {transform {phase s 13.0 13.6} {_estimateNumbers 2} {_averageFormula}}
                            _totalColor}
                        {transform {phase s 15.0 15.6} {_averageFormula} {_wFormula}}}}}}}]
    [# averageStruck {!if {< s 18.0}
        0.0
        {- {smooth {phase s 18.0 18.4}} {smooth {phase s 19.0 19.4}}}}]
    [# formula {!if {< s 18.0}
        estimate
        {_crossParts averageStruck estimate {' "sum" "M"} _weightColor}}]
    [# keep {!if {< s 17.0}
        {write {phase s 16.0 16.7} {_keepSymbols}}
        {fadeOut
            {phase s 21.2 21.6}
            {transform {phase s 17.3 18.0} {_keepSymbols} {_keepNumbers}}}}]
    [# {_under brace label toRight}
        [# b {boxOf brace}]
        [# l {nextTo label brace down 0.1}]
        {shift l {v2
            {!if toRight
                {- {+ {.x {.lo b}} {/ {widthOf l} 2.0}} {.x {centerOf l}}}
                {- {- {.x {.hi b}} {/ {widthOf l} 2.0}} {.x {centerOf l}}}}
            0.0}}]
    [# braceM {brace "braceM" {withId {_wFormula} "M"} down 0.1 textColor}]
    [# braceT {brace "braceT" {withId {_wFormula} "phat"} down 0.1 _targetColor}]
    [# braces {!if {< s 21.6}
        {'}
        {write
            {phase s 21.6 22.0}
            {flatten {'
                {braceLabel "braceSum"
                    {withId {_wFormula} "sum"}
                    up
                    0.1
                    _weightColor
                    {caption "braceSumText" {textKey "toymath-sum"} 0.34 _weightColor}}
                braceM
                {_under braceM
                    {caption "braceMText" {textKey "toymath-count"} 0.34 textColor}
                    false}
                braceT
                {shift
                    {_under braceT
                        {caption "braceTText" {textKey "toymath-target"} 0.34 _targetColor}
                        true}
                    {v2 0.0 -0.45}}}}}}]
    [# line {numberLine "line" _lineRange _lineA _lineB textDimColor 0.32}]
    [# dots {_dots s}]
    [# spread {braceLabel "spread" dots up 0.2 _estimateColor {tex "spreadText" f"{${_rational {toyEstimate 0 0}} \ldots ${_rational {toyEstimate 2 0}}}" 0.4
        _estimateColor}}]
    [# frame {frameBetween fullFrame {frameOn {append line spread} 0.5} {phase s 22.0 23.0}}]
    [# away {- 1.0 {smooth {phase s 22.0 22.6}}}]
    [# {_kept mobs} {!if {< away 1.0} {faded mobs away} mobs}]
    {append
        {_kept {flatten {'
            {!if {< s 7.0}
                {_tableShown s {tableShifted {_table 0} {v2 3.8 0.4}}}
                {fadeOut {phase s 21.2 21.6} tableNow}}
            {fadeOut {phase s 7.0 7.5} one}
            {_squareFigure s}
            {!if {< s 8.0} {'} {_listLit 0 s 8.0 false}}
            {!if {< s 9.0} {'} {_listLit 1 s 9.0 false}}
            {!if {< s 11.0} {'} {_listLit 2 s 11.0 false}}
            {!if {< s 17.0} {'} {_keptB s}}
            {!if {< s 8.0} {'} {_listLit 0 s 8.0 true}}
            {!if {< s 9.0} {'} {_listLit 1 s 9.0 true}}
            {!if {< s 11.0} {'} {_listLit 2 s 11.0 true}}
            {!if {< s 7.6} {'} formula}
            {!if {< s 16.0} {'} keep}
            braces}}}
        {flatten {'
            {create {phase s 7.5 8.0} line}
            dots
            {!if {< s 12.0} {'} {_marks s}}
            {fadeIn {phase s 22.2 22.8} spread}
            {showFrame frame}}}}} Math}]

Weighted reservoir sampling at one pixel

What the story draws on the canvas while P's candidates stream through a reservoir (chapter 2, beat `c2-wrs-stream`),
stage by stage as `wrsStage` goes from 0 to 17: the eight candidates as cards on a stream (a tape, at first), the
reservoir's record of three things, each candidate joining it (its weight into the sum, then its chance to
replace the kept one, against the number the update drew), the chance each ends kept, and the merge with a second
reservoir. The numbers are this frame's, from demos/ris.rs's trace of P's stream (the natives `risTrace`,
`risMerge`); before P's surface is read back the cards show no weights.

Fn([Int], String). The kept candidate's name as LaTeX (x_i), or nothing while none is kept.
$[# {_keptName k} {!if {< k 0} "" f"{x_{${str {+ k 1}}}}"}]
Fn([Float, Float], Float). `a` over `b`, or 0 when `b` is 0 (a candidate behind P's surface weighs nothing).
$[# {_over a b} {!if {> b 0.0} {/ a b} 0.0}]
Fn([Float], String). A weight as LaTeX, to three significant figures (two decimals at least, six at most).
$[# {_short x}
    [# digits {!if {<= x 0.0} 2 {clamp {- 2 {floor {/ {ln x} {ln 10.0}}}} 1 6}}]
    {numberLatex x {!if {>= x 10.0} 1 digits}}]

The stream's cards, along the top.
$[# _cardY 2.3]
Fn([Int, Int], Vec2). Card i's centre, of `n` in the row.
$[# {_cardAt i n} {v2 {* 1.6 {- {float i} {/ {float {- n 1}} 2.0}}} _cardY}]
Fn([Int], Float). The stage at which candidate i reaches the reservoir: the first at 6, the second at 7, the rest one
a stage from 9.
$[# {_joins i} {!if {= i 0} 6.0 {!if {= i 1} 7.0 {+ 9.0 {float {- i 2}}}}}]
Fn([Int], Float). The stage by which candidate i's weight is in the sum.
$[# {_joined i} {!if {< i 2} {+ {_joins i} 1.0} {+ {_joins i} 0.5}}]
Fn([Int], List(Float)). When candidate i's chance is weighed against its number: from, to (the first is kept as it
joins).
$[# {_decides i} {!if {= i 0}
    {' 6.0 7.0}
    {!if {= i 1} {' 8.0 9.0} {' {+ {_joins i} 0.5} {+ {_joins i} 1.0}}}}]

Fn([Vec2], List(Mob)). The highlight behind the card at `at`.
$[# {_cardLit at} {filled "lit"
    {box {sub2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}}}
    _targetColor
    0.25}]
Fn([Int, Int, List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Float], List(Mob)).
Card i: x_i and its weight, arriving at stage 0 to 1, dimmed once the reservoir has seen it, lit while it joins.
$[# {_card i n steps s}
    [# at {_cardAt i n}]
    [# frame {outlined f"{card${str i}}"
        {box {sub2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}}}
        textDimColor
        2.0}]
    [# name {moveTo
        {tex f"{cardName${str i}}" f"{x_{${str {+ i 1}}}}" 0.4 textColor}
        {add2 at {v2 0.0 0.2}}}]
    [# weight {!if {isEmpty steps}
        {'}
        {moveTo
            {tex f"{w${str i}}" {_short {.w {nth steps i}}} 0.34 _weightColor}
            {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.22}}}}]
    [# card {flatten {' frame name weight}}]
    [# arrived {fadeIn
        {phase s {* 0.11 {float i}} {+ 0.25 {* 0.11 {float i}}}}
        {shift card {v2
            {* 1.5 {- 1.0 {smooth {phase s {* 0.11 {float i}} {+ 0.25 {* 0.11 {float i}}}}}}}
            0.0}}}]
    [# seen {!if {>= s {nth {_decides i} 1}} 0.45 1.0}]
    [# lit {!and {>= s {_joins i}} {< s {nth {_decides i} 1}}}]
    {!if lit {append {_cardLit at} {faded arrived seen}} {faded arrived seen}}]

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The stream as a tape, stages 1 to 4: two reels and the tape between them, a read head
passing once along it (stage 2 to 3), the tape giving way to the stream's arrow and its words (stage 3 to 4).
$[# {_tape s}
    [# {_reel x} {pathThrough "reel"
        {map
            {range 0 33}
            {^ {k}
                [# a {* {/ {float k} 32.0} {* 2.0 pi}}]
                {v2 {+ x {* 0.55 {cos a}}} {+ _cardY {* 0.55 {sin a}}}}}}
        textDimColor
        2.5}]
    [# tape {flatten {'
        {_reel -6.6}
        {_reel 6.6}
        {line "tapeTop" {v2 -6.6 {+ _cardY 0.55}} {v2 6.6 {+ _cardY 0.55}} textDimColor 2.0}
        {line "tapeBottom" {v2 -6.6 {- _cardY 0.55}} {v2 6.6 {- _cardY 0.55}} textDimColor 2.0}}}]
    [# head {arrowLine "head"
        {v2 {lerp -5.6 5.6 {smooth {phase s 2.0 3.0}}} {- _cardY 1.3}}
        {v2 {lerp -5.6 5.6 {smooth {phase s 2.0 3.0}}} {- _cardY 0.65}}
        accentColor
        3.0}]
    [# stream {append
        {arrowLine "stream" {v2 -6.6 {+ _cardY 0.75}} {v2 6.6 {+ _cardY 0.75}} textDimColor 2.0}
        {moveTo
            {caption "streamText" {textKey "wrsmath-stream"} 0.34 textDimColor}
            {v2 0.0 {+ _cardY 1.05}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeOut {phase s 3.0 3.5} {create {phase s 1.0 1.6} tape}}
        {!if {!and {>= s 2.0} {< s 3.2}} head {'}}
        {fadeIn {phase s 3.3 4.0} stream}}}]

The reservoir's record: the kept candidate, the sum of weights, and the count.
$[# _recordPlace [% {v2 -2.6 -1.0}]]
Fn([Vec2, String, String, String, String, Float], List(Mob)). A record at `at` showing `kept`, `sum`, and `count`
(LaTeX; empty strings leave a field blank), its fields named under `id` and captioned, `alpha` its frame's.
$[# {_record id at kept sum count}
    [# box3 {box {sub2 at {v2 2.7 0.55}} {add2 at {v2 2.7 0.55}}}]
    [# xs {' -1.8 0.0 1.8}]
    [# {_field k key value}
        [# c {add2 at {v2 {nth xs k} 0.0}}]
        {append
            {moveTo
                {caption {++ id {++ "Cap" {str k}}} key 0.3 textDimColor}
                {add2 c {v2 0.0 0.85}}}
            {!if {= value ""} {'} {moveTo {tex {++ id {++ "F" {str k}}} value 0.44 textColor} c}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {outlined {++ id "Box"} box3 textColor 2.5}
        {line {++ id "Rule"} {add2 at {v2 -0.9 -0.55}} {add2 at {v2 -0.9 0.55}} textDimColor 1.5}
        {line {++ id "Rule"} {add2 at {v2 0.9 -0.55}} {add2 at {v2 0.9 0.55}} textDimColor 1.5}
        {_field 0 {textKey "wrsmath-kept"} kept}
        {_field 1 {textKey "wrsmath-sum"} sum}
        {_field 2 {textKey "wrsmath-count"} count}}}]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Int, Float], List(String)). What
the first reservoir's record shows at stage s: the kept candidate, the sum (counting up as a weight joins), and the
count.
$[# {_fieldsAt s steps split}
    [# joined {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {>= s {_joins i}}}}]
    [# decided {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {>= s {nth {_decides i} 1}}}}]
    [# last {!if {isEmpty joined} -1 {nth joined {- {length joined} 1}}}]
    [# before {!if {< last 1} 0.0 {.wsum {nth steps {- last 1}}}}]
    [# sum {!if {< last 0}
        0.0
        {lerp before {.wsum {nth steps last}} {smooth {phase s {_joins last} {_joined last}}}}}]
    [# kept {!if {isEmpty decided} -1 {.kept {nth steps {nth decided {- {length decided} 1}}}}}]
    {' {_keptName kept} {!if {< last 0} "" {_short sum}} {!if {< last 0} "" {str {length joined}}}}]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Float, Int], List(Mob)). Candidate
i weighing its chance at stage s: its weight over the new sum, the chance as a lit part of a bar from 0 to 1, and
the number its update drew dropping onto the bar (inside the lit part, it replaces the kept one).
$[# {_weigh steps s i}
    [# step {nth steps i}]
    [# c {_over {.w step} {.wsum step}}]
    [# t {phase s {nth {_decides i} 0} {nth {_decides i} 1}}]
    [# at {v2 4.4 -0.2}]
    [# formula {moveTo
        {texParts "chanceF" f"{\frac{\lit{1}{w_{${str {+ i 1}}}}}{\lit{2}{w_{\text{sum}}}} = \frac{\lit{3}{${_short {.w step}}}}{\lit{4}{${_short {.wsum step}}}} = \lit{5}{${numberLatex c 2}}}" 0.4 textColor
            {' "w" "sum" "wv" "sv" "c"}
            {' _weightColor textColor _weightColor textColor _estimateColor}}
        at}]
    [# x0 2.4]
    [# x1 6.4]
    [# y -1.6]
    [# track {filled "track" {box {v2 x0 {- y 0.14}} {v2 x1 {+ y 0.14}}} "#3b4150" 1.0}]
    [# lit {filled "litChance"
        {box {v2 x0 {- y 0.14}} {v2 {lerp x0 x1 {* c {smooth {phase t 0.1 0.4}}}} {+ y 0.14}}}
        _estimateColor
        0.9}]
    [# ux {lerp x0 x1 {.u step}}]
    [# drop {smooth {phase t 0.45 0.75}}]
    [# u {append
        {arrowLine "u"
            {v2 ux {+ y {lerp 1.2 0.6 drop}}}
            {v2 ux {+ y {lerp 0.75 0.18 drop}}}
            {!if {.taken step} _targetColor textColor}
            3.0}
        {moveTo {tex "uText" "u" 0.36 textColor} {v2 ux {+ y {lerp 1.45 0.85 drop}}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeIn {phase t 0.0 0.2} formula}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.0 0.1}
            {append track {moveTo {tex "zero" "0" 0.3 textDimColor} {v2 x0 {- y 0.42}}}}}
        {fadeIn {phase t 0.0 0.1} {moveTo {tex "one" "1" 0.3 textDimColor} {v2 x1 {- y 0.42}}}}
        lit
        {fadeIn {phase t 0.4 0.5} u}}}]
Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Int, Float], List(Mob)). The
candidate weighing its chance at stage s, if one is.
$[# {_chance steps split s}
    [# now {filter
        {range 1 split}
        {^ {i} {!and {>= s {nth {_decides i} 0}} {< s {nth {_decides i} 1}}}}}]
    {!if {isEmpty now} {'} {_weigh steps s {head now}}}]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Int, Float], List(Mob)). The
name of a candidate that replaces the kept one, flying from its card into the record's first field over the last
half of its chance (the record shows it once its chance is weighed).
$[# {_keptFly steps split s}
    [# flying {filter
        {range 0 split}
        {^ {i}
            [# d {_decides i}]
            {!and {.taken {nth steps i}} {>= s {lerp {nth d 0} {nth d 1} 0.5}} {< s {nth d 1}}}}}]
    {flatten {map flying {^ {i}
        [# d {_decides i}]
        [# from {moveTo
            {tex "flyName" {_keptName i} 0.4 textColor}
            {add2 {_cardAt i split} {v2 0.0 0.2}}}]
        [# to {moveTo
            {tex "flyName" {_keptName i} 0.44 textColor}
            {add2 _recordPlace {v2 -1.8 0.0}}}]
        {fromCopy {phase s {lerp {nth d 0} {nth d 1} 0.5} {nth d 1}} from to}}}}]

The scene

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The stream through a reservoir at stage `wrsStage`.
$[# wrsMath {: {^ {t}
    [# s {wrsStage}]
    [# steps {risTrace}]
    [# ready {not {isEmpty steps}}]
    [# merge {risMerge}]
    [# n {!if ready {length steps} 8}]
    [# split {!if ready {.split merge} 8}]
    [# cards {flatten {map {range 0 split} {^ {i} {_card i split steps s}}}}]
    [# fields {!if ready {_fieldsAt s steps split} {' "" "" ""}}]
    [# recordA {_record "A" _recordPlace {nth fields 0} {nth fields 1} {nth fields 2}}]
    [# record {!if {< s 4.0}
        {'}
        {circumscribe {phase s 5.0 6.0} {write {phase s 4.0 4.8} recordA} _targetColor}}]
    [# keptNow {!if ready {.kept {nth steps {- split 1}}} -1}]
    [# chances {!if {!or {not ready} {< s 15.0}}
        {'}
        {flatten {map
            {range 0 split}
            {^ {i}
                [# total {.wsum {nth steps {- split 1}}}]
                [# c {_over {.w {nth steps i}} total}]
                [# at {_cardAt i split}]
                [# bar {filled f"{chanceBar${str i}}"
                    {box {v2 {- {.x at} 0.3} 0.4} {v2 {+ {.x at} 0.3} {+ 0.4 {* 1.2 c}}}}
                    _estimateColor
                    0.85}]
                {append
                    {growFrom
                        {phase s {+ 15.0 {* 0.05 {float i}}} {+ 15.5 {* 0.05 {float i}}}}
                        bar
                        down}
                    {fadeIn
                        {phase s 15.4 15.8}
                        {nextTo
                            {tex f"{chance${str i}}" {numberLatex c 2} 0.3 _estimateColor}
                            bar
                            up
                            0.08}}}}}}}]
    [# keptCard {!if {!and ready {>= s 15.6}}
        {circumscribe {phase s 15.6 16.0} {withId cards f"{card${str keptNow}}"} _targetColor}
        {'}}]
    [# second {!if {!or {not ready} {<= n split}}
        {'}
        {_record "B"
            {v2 4.0 -0.7}
            {_keptName {.kept {nth steps {- n 1}}}}
            {_short {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}}
            {str {- n split}}}}]
    [# total {!if ready
        {+ {.wsum {nth steps {- split 1}}} {!if {> n split} {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}} 0.0}}
        0.0}]
    [# merged {_record "A" {v2 0.0 -2.9} {_keptName {.kept merge}} {_short total} {str n}}]
    [# merging {!if {!or {< s 16.0} {<= n split}}
        {'}
        {flatten {'
            {fadeIn {phase s 16.0 16.3} second}
            {transform {phase s 16.4 17.0} {append record second} merged}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {_tape s}
        cards
        chances
        keptCard
        {!if {>= s 16.0} {!if {<= n split} record {fadeOut {phase s 16.4 16.6} {'}}} record}
        {!if {!and ready {>= s 6.0} {< s 15.0}} {_chance steps split s} {'}}
        {!if ready {_keptFly steps split s} {'}}
        merging}}} Math}]
